1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:06,280
Taming The Husband

3
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,920
Episode 7

4
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,800
You're in charge here.

5
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,720
Well? How should she be punished?

6
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:23,600
Madam,

7
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,800
I've failed to raise my daughter properly.

8
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,720
Please punish me.

9
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,400
Sneaking into a gambling house
was bad enough.

10
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,480
Getting an outsider to lie for her

11
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:38,000
and disgrace our family?

12
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,640
She deserves a severe punishment.

13
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,640
Xie Xi, from this moment,

14
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,400
you're confined for three months.

15
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,160
Copy <i>Lessons for Women</i>

16
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,840
and <i>Xie Family Precepts</i> once each day.

17
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:53,080
No food until you've finished.

18
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,000
Dock half a month's-- No.

19
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,480
Dock six months of her public allowance.

20
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,520
Stay in your room and reflect.

21
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:04,640
Grandmother, Xi normally

22
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,120
never sets foot outside the house.

23
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,680
If one of our own hadn't gone there,

24
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,000
and she hadn't tried to stop them,

25
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,800
how would she have ended up there?

26
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,400
She was foolish.
She deserves punishment.

27
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,120
But concern clouded her judgment.

28
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:17,120
She couldn't bear to see you,
Grandmother, kept in the dark,

29
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,120
or our family disgraced.

30
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,280
Shouldn't they be punished, too?

31
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,360
<i>But if we expose their wrongdoing,</i>

32
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,320
<i>we won't escape punishment ourselves.</i>

33
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,560
<i>I was in the wrong first anyway.</i>

34
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,960
<i>I'll take the punishment.</i>

35
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,640
<i>At least I can take someone down with me!</i>

36
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:40,920
<i>It's not that easy.</i>

37
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,600
<i>I won't help you when that happens.</i>

38
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:46,240
<i>Do you really think</i>
<i>you can stand up to people that powerful?</i>

39
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,200
My brother lost his head over gambling

40
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,920
and staked our family home.

41
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,120
I was the one
who took a valuable to settle his debt.

42
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,160
You didn't "take" it. You stole it!

43
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,600
Still trying to talk your way out of it?

44
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,440
I may be poor and ignorant,

45
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:07,840
but even poor people know shame.
We have our pride, too!

46
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,200
I was already saving up to buy it back.

47
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:13,000
I was foolish.
I didn't know I'd broken the rules.

48
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,840
After all those lessons,

49
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,640
what have you learned?

50
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,600
I've learned this.

51
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,320
I may be lowborn,

52
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:24,640
but my heart is no less worthy than yours,
however grand your birth!

53
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,680
I, Jin Baozhu, answer for what I do.
I admit my guilt.

54
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,040
But Xie Yan is innocent.

55
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:34,000
I kept it from him when I took...

56
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,760
stole that valuable.

57
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,560
He only found out later, by chance,

58
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,200
and had to recover it.

59
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,440
He did nothing wrong.
He shouldn't be punished.

60
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,800
Besides, the gambling house owner
is no fool.

61
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,440
He knew my brother

62
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,640
hadn't a coin left.

63
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,200
Why lend him more money?

64
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,080
He stood to lose everything he lent!

65
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:52,640
He knew all about me the moment I arrived.

66
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,480
Someone must have told him in advance,

67
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,960
had him approach my brother,

68
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,160
then find a way

69
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:58,800
to force us to gamble.

70
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,280
But who

71
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,400
told him all this?

72
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:09,520
Why are you looking at me?

73
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:11,280
Look at whoever lured you to the table.

74
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,560
Fine. First,

75
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,280
when I went to the Lu estate for my money,

76
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,760
I saw Xie Xi sitting beside Lu Ziyu.

77
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,720
Second, at the gambling house,

78
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,640
I saw them on the second floor,
standing together.

79
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,680
Third, that Lu Ziyu

80
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,280
is a spineless coward.

81
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,400
For Xie Xi's sake,

82
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,200
terrified as he was,
he still testified for her.

83
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,800
And he claims he has no ties
to the second branch!

84
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:33,760
Who'd believe that?
If you didn't know the owner,

85
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,040
how did you get the best seats upstairs?

86
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,600
The second branch

87
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,720
conspired with outsiders

88
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,840
to force Xie Yan and me to gamble!

89
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,920
I was foolish

90
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,080
and fell into your trap.

91
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,000
But none of you are innocent!

92
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:49,560
Will you admit your guilt
and accept your punishment?

93
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:52,160
Is she telling the truth?

94
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,160
No! My mother had nothing to do with it!

95
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,320
Xi had a few quarrels with her,

96
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:01,800
and I was angry.
So I asked Master Lu to help.

97
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:05,400
Who knew he'd...
Who knew he'd act without telling me

98
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,880
and come up with such a rotten plan?

99
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,120
I only just found out!

100
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,960
Grandmother,
it was just a quarrel between us children.

101
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,880
You'll be punished, too.

102
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,640
When you come of age this year,

103
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,320
you will not be allowed aboard.

104
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:22,040
Reflect on your conduct for three months.

105
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,720
Do this again,

106
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,920
and there will be no mercy.

107
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,600
Yes.

108
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:30,480
And you.
Punish or reprimand them as appropriate.

109
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,800
When you're done,

110
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,080
report to me.

111
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,560
Yes, Mother.

112
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:49,600
They were all
born with silver spoons in their mouths.

113
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:52,120
Someone picks them up when they fall.

114
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,480
And you?

115
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,440
One false step,

116
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:58,920
and it's all downhill from there.

117
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,960
The Xie ancestral hall

118
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:25,480
Jin Baozhu,
you stole valuables from this house,

119
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,120
led your husband into gambling,

120
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,960
and deceived everyone.

121
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:30,560
That compounds your guilt.

122
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,760
Twenty strokes of the cane,
then you're to be sold off.

123
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,160
Begin!

124
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:43,200
I won't kneel.
I'll take my punishment standing.

125
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:45,920
Defying the lady of the house?

126
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,440
Another offense!

127
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:48,800
Beat her again!

128
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,320
Stop!

129
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:00,160
Honor our ancestors' blessings

130
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:34,240
Lady Qin is only in charge temporarily.

131
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,640
She's not the lady of the house!

132
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,920
She didn't steal it.

133
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,640
She borrowed it to save her family.
And it's been returned intact.

134
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:43,640
Nor did she make me gamble.

135
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,240
I chose to do it.

136
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,680
Under the household rules,

137
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,000
she merits a few dozen lashes at most.

138
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,240
Why go this far?

139
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,480
Her name is Jin,

140
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,400
not Xie.

141
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:59,640
The household rules
apply to family members.

142
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,680
She's a common thief, an outsider!

143
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,200
<i>My husband, Xie Yan,</i>

144
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,160
<i>is Yangzhou's renowned scholar!</i>

145
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,680
<i>Who are you to insult him?</i>

146
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,120
Begin the caning!

147
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,680
Get lost!

148
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,000
Jin Baozhu is my lawful bride.

149
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,840
She's on my household register.
She belongs with me.

150
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:19,120
Her misconduct is my responsibility.

151
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:20,480
Lady Qin, if someone must be punished,

152
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:22,640
punish me.

153
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,280
Xie Yan!

154
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,600
Yan, have you lost your mind?

155
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,600
The Xies have already ruined my legs.

156
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,200
What's one more beating?

157
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:39,560
Mind your words, my lord.

158
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,960
Everyone in this household knows

159
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:46,320
how your father dotes on you.

160
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:48,240
And who am I?

161
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:50,240
I'm only a lowly concubine.

162
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,920
If anyone asks, Lady Qin,

163
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:53,600
just tell them the truth.

164
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,360
Will that satisfy you?

165
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,000
It will.

166
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,160
As long as you're satisfied.

167
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,800
Someone! Take her away!

168
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,440
No! No!

169
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,560
-Move!
-No!

170
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,280
Xie Yan!

171
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,800
Come here.

172
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,680
Xie Yan! Xie Yan!

173
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,800
Begin the caning!

174
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,640
Xie Yan!

175
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,560
Xie Yan!

176
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,040
My brother's taking your beating.

177
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:31,280
If you won't see sense
and let his suffering be in vain,

178
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,720
I'll kill you!

179
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:02,800
Xie Yan, if it hurts,

180
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:04,800
hold my hand.

181
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,520
Mind your own business.

182
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,680
Go.

183
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,640
Mother.

184
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,240
You're back.

185
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:56,720
-Tired after today?
-No.

186
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,360
What did your father say this time?

187
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,840
He kept you so late.

188
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,560
This year, he's pushed himself too hard
traveling with Uncle Chengzong.

189
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:05,000
his health is suffering.

190
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:07,040
He wants a longer rest before leaving.

191
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,080
Here. Have some water.

192
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:13,000
This is the private allowance
I saved while I was away this year.

193
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:15,960
Keep it safe, and don't tell anyone.

194
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,240
Keep it for yourself.

195
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:20,200
Take it, Mother.
Think of it as my board for a while.

196
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,560
You dear child. All right.

197
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:34,280
He also brought up marriage.

198
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,640
Even Yan is married now.

199
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,640
If you don't marry soon,

200
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:45,080
it'll be hard to explain.

201
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,760
He said he hoped I'd find a good family,

202
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,920
preferably in the same trade,

203
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,920
so we could help each other.

204
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,280
What did you say?

205
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:02,120
I said I'm away so much,

206
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,640
I'd only let down
a girl from a good family.

207
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,200
I talked around it for a while,

208
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,400
and put him off for this year.

209
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:16,760
But I feel bad for you, Mother,

210
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,640
with no one here to keep you company.

211
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,000
Silly child.

212
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,240
I'm quite happy on my own.

213
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:39,680
You forget everything
at the sight of money.

214
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:42,600
You think I'm a miser like you?

215
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:45,720
I'm laughing
because I saw quite a show today.

216
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:48,280
That new concubine is a delight!

217
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,640
Barking at everyone.

218
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,160
She nearly tore Qin Kehan

219
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,800
to pieces!

220
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,680
I couldn't say this earlier,

221
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:57,320
but when they were arguing,
why did you have to stir things up?

222
00:12:57,840 --> 00:13:00,240
Mother hates these struggles for power.

223
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,120
You need to be careful.

224
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:04,320
Wasn't it your brother who started it?

225
00:13:04,680 --> 00:13:06,920
When he went to serve at court,

226
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:09,480
he left us to hold things together.

227
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:12,040
And then? His son got into trouble,

228
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:14,240
he lost his post,

229
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,880
and came slinking home.

230
00:13:16,520 --> 00:13:18,120
Now he wants to run the household again.

231
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,360
Where does that leave us?

232
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,040
What are you so angry about?

233
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,680
I may be his half-brother,
born to a concubine,

234
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:24,280
but I have the skill and experience.

235
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:26,080
I'm his right-hand man.

236
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:28,200
He can't manage without me out there.

237
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:29,960
Even here at home,

238
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,640
I'm the one Mother favors more.

239
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,800
You'd better be right.

240
00:13:34,120 --> 00:13:35,320
Don't worry so much.

241
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:38,320
Mother said so herself.

242
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,160
She thought Heng's gift

243
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,560
was better than his.

244
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,040
She even called Heng

245
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,760
the best of the lot!

246
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,720
That reminds me of something funny.

247
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,080
What?

248
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:58,080
These past few days,
I've had the side gate guards

249
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,320
pick garden balsam for me.

250
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:02,120
When Lady Jin sneaked out,

251
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,000
it was partly thanks to me!

252
00:14:04,720 --> 00:14:05,760
It's hilarious!

253
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,520
You were lucky.

254
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,440
She didn't drag you into it.

255
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,840
You know what would have happened.

256
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,840
What are you daydreaming about?

257
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:23,080
Enough. Let me.

258
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:24,280
Yes.

259
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,960
Honestly!

260
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:29,280
His mind's been

261
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:32,360
elsewhere lately.

262
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:34,440
Without a letter of recommendation,

263
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:36,360
he can't go to the capital
for the medical officer exam.

264
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:39,080
He's worried sick. Aren't you?

265
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,400
Yes.

266
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,400
Jianwei, why does he have

267
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,480
so many old wounds?

268
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:04,080
Jin Baozhu! Jin Baozhu!

269
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:10,960
Get out here!

270
00:15:12,160 --> 00:15:13,240
You--

271
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,360
Get out!

272
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:16,400
I'm not leaving. We have an agreement.

273
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:18,720
You got him punished,
and you still have the nerve to stay?

274
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,640
When he wakes, he may not want to see you.

275
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:23,000
This house is far too humble
for someone as grand as you.

276
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,480
Ask to be released and leave.

277
00:15:24,800 --> 00:15:25,880
Get out!

278
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,280
Get out!

279
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,080
Then take good care of him.

280
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:34,320
I'll be just outside. Call if you need me.

281
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,760
Go. Go.

282
00:16:02,760 --> 00:16:04,320
<i>Why don't we have New Year couplets</i>

283
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:05,440
<i>and lanterns in our courtyard?</i>

284
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,320
<i>I had everything prepared.</i>

285
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:10,720
<i>I'm just waiting for you to come home.</i>

286
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,080
You're so clever.

287
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,120
Can you tell me

288
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:19,400
where I should go?

289
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,320
<i>It's not that easy.</i>

290
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,520
<i>I won't help you when that happens.</i>

291
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,160
You're so clever.

292
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,960
Can you tell me

293
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,440
why you...

294
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,480
What are you doing here?

295
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:09,880
I've repaid my debt to you,

296
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,560
but I still owe Young Master Xie.

297
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,280
This is an ointment I made myself.

298
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,320
It works faster. Take it.

299
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:25,640
I take Madam's pulse,

300
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:28,680
and whenever a servant falls ill,
they come to me.

301
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:30,560
You saw that for yourself.

302
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,760
Take it.

303
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,400
You've been busy all this time.

304
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:50,200
I thought you might not have eaten.

305
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:53,120
The kitchen leftovers
were all taken by the servants.

306
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:56,160
There's nothing left.
This was all I could find.

307
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,560
What are these?

308
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:03,640
Grapes. I once read

309
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:05,520
that somewhere in the West,

310
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:08,080
at New Year,
people eat grapes as the clock chimes.

311
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,520
The more grapes you eat,

312
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,320
the luckier you'll be next year.

313
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,280
Thank you.

314
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:19,400
But he doesn't want to see me.

315
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:21,920
Could you take this in to him for me?

316
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,600
What's a chiming clock?

317
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:33,040
Something like a water clock, I suppose.

318
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,040
There's a Western clock here.

319
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:37,840
It chimes at midnight.

320
00:18:38,600 --> 00:18:39,720
Unfortunately,

321
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:41,200
it's past midnight now.

322
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:44,880
Another day.
I'll take you to hear it another day.

323
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,480
What's wrong?

324
00:20:00,760 --> 00:20:03,560
I... I didn't know grapes had seeds.

325
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,000
While he was still asleep,

326
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,160
I took his pulse.

327
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,280
There's hope for his legs.

328
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,760
What?

329
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:23,000
Xie Yan's legs can recover.

330
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:38,320
He's awake.

331
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,240
Where am I?

332
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:47,200
The morning air's fresh out here.

333
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:49,080
Better than that stuffy room.

334
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:51,600
So I had them bring you out for some air.

335
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:55,080
Where's Jin Baozhu?

336
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,320
I've been here since early morning,

337
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,440
but I haven't seen her.

338
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:00,640
Lie back down.

339
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:03,720
Be good. Here.

340
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:05,960
Careful.

341
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,520
Still hurts?

342
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:17,480
As for the second branch,

343
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,680
Yi told me what happened.

344
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:22,880
Don't worry. Your mother's here.

345
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:24,960
I'll see that you're treated fairly.

346
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:33,360
Yan.

347
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:38,840
Don't come any closer.

348
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:48,920
I know the sight of me upsets you.

349
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:51,280
You won't even tell me when you're hurt.

350
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:55,880
Can't I look at you from a distance,
at least?

351
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:57,760
I'd rather you didn't look at all.

352
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,480
I asked him to come.

353
00:22:27,600 --> 00:22:29,440
Why is Yan the one who's hurt?

354
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:31,800
Shouldn't that Jin woman be punished?

355
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:33,360
Have her brought here at once!

356
00:22:34,960 --> 00:22:36,320
If you really care about him,

357
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:37,920
get your facts straight first,

358
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:39,280
then do something useful.

359
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:43,560
Then I'll find some good doctors.

360
00:22:44,080 --> 00:22:47,520
There's no need.
I can treat these surface wounds.

361
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:49,440
Do what you should be doing.

362
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,200
Must you make me

363
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:52,440
play the villain?

364
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,600
Kehan was only being fair.

365
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:57,760
You've already failed Hanzhang.

366
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:01,320
Don't fail her child as well.

367
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:14,680
Have you taken the medicines?

368
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:16,080
Any you liked?

369
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,480
I'll bring some more next time.

370
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,240
I don't remember.

371
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:28,400
My illness
comes from years of pent-up sorrow.

372
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:30,080
It's left me weak,

373
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:31,880
and medicine can't cure the cause.

374
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:35,880
Better to save that money

375
00:23:36,040 --> 00:23:38,200
and add to Yan's private allowance.

376
00:23:47,120 --> 00:23:48,640
He's resting now.

377
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,400
You should go, too.

378
00:23:59,560 --> 00:24:01,920
Fetch some medicine from Master Song.

379
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:04,400
Will you remember?

380
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,560
Yes.

381
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:20,360
Where's that little terror?
What trouble is she stirring up now?

382
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:23,720
Yi wouldn't let her in last night,

383
00:24:23,800 --> 00:24:25,280
so she waited at the door all night.

384
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:26,800
I don't know if she's gone back.

385
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,760
Is she in her room?

386
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,760
I just checked.

387
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,360
Lady Jin isn't there.

388
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:34,880
That little fool.

389
00:24:35,880 --> 00:24:37,640
Still making me worry at a time like this!

390
00:24:42,040 --> 00:24:44,800
Last night, what did Xie Yi say to her?

391
00:24:50,760 --> 00:24:51,840
Tell me.

392
00:24:57,960 --> 00:24:59,160
Jin Baozhu! Jin Baozhu!

393
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,400
Get out here!

394
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:02,600
I have to look after him.
We have an agreement.

395
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:05,080
You got him punished,
and you still have the nerve to stay?

396
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:07,400
He has people to look after him.

397
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:10,120
This house is far too humble
for someone as grand as you.

398
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,840
Ask to be released and leave.

399
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:16,960
This is bad.

400
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:20,880
Stubborn fool.

401
00:25:22,040 --> 00:25:23,560
Now she decides to do as she's told!

402
00:25:30,840 --> 00:25:33,160
What are you standing there for?
Help me find her, quickly!

403
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:39,080
I'm a fool, too.

404
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:42,040
She barely knows any characters.

405
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:44,160
How could she write
a petition for release?

406
00:25:56,840 --> 00:25:57,960
Jianwei,

407
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:03,200
let it go.

408
00:26:06,760 --> 00:26:09,360
My lord, but it's your favorite bird.

409
00:26:12,520 --> 00:26:13,640
I don't want it anymore.

410
00:26:16,320 --> 00:26:17,440
Yes.

411
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:41,680
I'm tired. Take me back to rest.

412
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:44,040
Yes.

413
00:27:26,640 --> 00:27:27,920
Now you know.

414
00:27:29,200 --> 00:27:30,760
This house is a lion's den.

415
00:27:31,680 --> 00:27:32,680
Why come back?

416
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,520
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

417
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:40,200
I know you don't want to see me.

418
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:43,320
I'm just glad you're all right.

419
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:44,440
I'll go.

420
00:27:53,640 --> 00:27:54,760
I'm not all right!

421
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,840
What makes you think
there's nothing wrong with me?

422
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:03,760
You can still bicker.

423
00:28:04,080 --> 00:28:05,480
You seem fine to me.

424
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:40,320
Didn't you leave? Why come back?

425
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:43,880
I broke valuables in this house,

426
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:45,600
worth 1,998 taels.

427
00:28:45,680 --> 00:28:46,760
Since I have no money to pay,

428
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:48,400
I'll stay in the Xie estate to serve you,

429
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,480
at your beck and call.

430
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:51,960
Laundry, cleaning, serving tea and water.

431
00:28:52,560 --> 00:28:54,240
I'll do all the rough and heavy work.

432
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:56,200
You'll obey every order in this house.

433
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:58,120
You'll work off your debt.

434
00:28:58,200 --> 00:29:00,720
After three years,
you'll owe nothing, and you'll be free.

435
00:29:02,560 --> 00:29:04,080
You're a fast learner.

436
00:29:05,560 --> 00:29:09,320
Is this what they mean by
"A dying man's words are kind"?

437
00:29:10,360 --> 00:29:11,760
Can't you say one decent thing?

438
00:29:12,680 --> 00:29:13,920
I taught you perfectly good sayings,

439
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,000
and you talk such nonsense!

440
00:29:25,440 --> 00:29:26,520
What are you doing?

441
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:28,400
I'll put the medicine on.

442
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:31,080
I'll put it on your legs.
Give you a massage.

443
00:29:32,040 --> 00:29:33,640
<i>The meridians in his legs</i>
<i>are severely blocked.</i>

444
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,920
<i>Pain-relieving powder alone</i>
<i>treats the symptoms, not the cause.</i>

445
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:37,960
<i>He needs daily therapeutic massage</i>

446
00:29:38,040 --> 00:29:39,040
<i>to improve circulation</i>
<i>and clear the blockages.</i>

447
00:29:39,120 --> 00:29:40,240
<i>Only then can he improve.</i>

448
00:29:42,040 --> 00:29:46,200
<i>Look.</i>
<i>First, put the medicine in your palm.</i>

449
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,600
<i>Rub your hands until they're warm.</i>

450
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,280
<i>Then put your hands on either side</i>
<i>of the legs.</i>

451
00:29:49,880 --> 00:29:51,240
<i>Press the acupuncture points</i>

452
00:29:51,800 --> 00:29:53,400
<i>to work the medicine in.</i>

453
00:29:53,600 --> 00:29:55,200
<i>Start gently, then increase the pressure,</i>

454
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:56,320
<i>a little at a time.</i>

455
00:29:56,600 --> 00:29:58,440
<i>Remember, don't press too hard.</i>

456
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:05,400
<i>Relax your palm.</i>

457
00:30:08,040 --> 00:30:09,040
<i>Relax your wrist.</i>

458
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:11,680
<i>Follow the meridians.</i>

459
00:30:15,600 --> 00:30:16,840
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

460
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:19,800
<i>Doing this on your own legs</i>
<i>is awkward, isn't it?</i>

461
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:23,360
<i>How about this?</i>
<i>Find someone suitable to practice on.</i>

462
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,080
<i>I'll take you through it slowly.</i>

463
00:30:27,600 --> 00:30:28,680
<i>Surely you've repaid</i>

464
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:29,920
<i>what you owe us?</i>

465
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:32,240
<i>Why go to all that trouble</i>
<i>when there's nothing in it for you?</i>

466
00:30:34,840 --> 00:30:36,360
<i>Because I need something from you both.</i>

467
00:30:41,280 --> 00:30:42,400
Who taught you that?

468
00:30:42,960 --> 00:30:45,560
The... one I bought the extra meat for.

469
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:46,760
You really bought him extra meat?

470
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,960
I got you two extra scoops!

471
00:30:57,320 --> 00:31:00,920
Go. So many doctors
have already examined me.

472
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:03,160
My legs have long been beyond saving.

473
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,760
How do you know unless you try?

474
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,040
Jin Baozhu,

475
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:11,080
if your mother promised

476
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:12,880
that if you worked hard,

477
00:31:13,160 --> 00:31:14,560
she'd give you an egg,

478
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,880
but though you worked hard every day,

479
00:31:17,040 --> 00:31:19,120
she never gave you one,

480
00:31:20,200 --> 00:31:21,600
how would you feel?

481
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:26,840
I'd be hurt.

482
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:32,160
So many people

483
00:31:33,280 --> 00:31:34,680
have promised me eggs.

484
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:39,480
Now I don't want
to get my hopes up for nothing again.

485
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:44,160
Trying doesn't
guarantee you an egg,

486
00:31:44,320 --> 00:31:46,440
but not trying
guarantees you none. Right?

487
00:31:53,280 --> 00:31:54,280
Your leg...

488
00:31:54,360 --> 00:31:56,720
Get out. Get out!

489
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:00,960
Why?

490
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:01,960

